Select <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-intelligence/">Apple Intelligence</a> features <a href="https://www.apple.com.cn/newsroom/2026/10/apple-intelligence-features-are-coming-to-users-in-china/">are now available in China</a>, with Apple testing the functionality in the iOS 27.3 beta. Developers in China can turn on &zwnj;Apple Intelligence&zwnj; after updating to the new software.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/apple-intelligence-china.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1075480" /><br/>
&zwnj;Apple Intelligence&zwnj; first launched in the United States with iOS 18.1, but Apple was not able to bring it to China until it partnered with Alibaba and won approval from Chinese regulators.<br/>
<br/>
&zwnj;Apple Intelligence&zwnj; features like <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a>, Writing Tools, and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/visual-intelligence/">Visual Intelligence</a> integrate Alibaba's Qwen model. Here's what's live:<br/>
<ul><br/>
 	<li>Live Translation for Messages, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/facetime/">FaceTime</a>, and the Phone app. Live Translation also works with AirPods 4 with ANC, AirPods Pro 2, and later models.</li><br/>
 	<li>Writing Tools for rewriting, proofreading, and summarizing text. With Qwen integration, users can also generate text.</li><br/>
 	<li>&zwnj;Visual Intelligence&zwnj; for identifying objects, places, and more.</li><br/>
 	<li>Clean Up in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/photos/">Photos</a> for removing unwanted objects from images.</li><br/>
 	<li><a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/genmoji/">Genmoji</a> for creating custom emoji.</li><br/>
 	<li>Natural language search and memory movie creation in &zwnj;Photos&zwnj;.</li><br/>
 	<li>Email summaries, suggested smart replies, and priority emails in the Mail app.</li><br/>
 	<li>Notification summaries, urgent notifications, and the Reduce Interruptions Focus mode.</li><br/>
 	<li>Summaries for audio recordings in the Notes app.</li><br/>
 	<li>Call transcripts in the Phone app, which are saved to the Notes app.</li><br/>
 	<li>Type to &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; and more natural &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; responses.</li><br/>
 	<li>&zwnj;Siri&zwnj; can relay requests to Qwen to give more in-depth answers.</li><br/>
</ul><br/>
&zwnj;Apple Intelligence&zwnj; in China does not include &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; AI, the &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; app, or the newer &zwnj;Apple Intelligence&zwnj; features in <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>.<br/>
<br/>
